/target
Cargo.lock

# Harness state — never operate on. See docs/COMPACTION-AMNESIA-RECOVERY.md § FM 7-bis.
.claude/worktrees/

# Ephemeral arc/stone cascade tooling (build → use → delete). Repo-local scratch
# pad — the sandbox firewall denies /tmp/. See docs/DUNGEON-CRAWL.md § cascade.
/tools/

# Coverage artifacts (arc 252 gate). LLVM_PROFILE_FILE emits *.profraw; an
# instrumented build that lingers makes plain `cargo test` drop default_*.profraw
# in CWD. The lcov is regenerated each gate run. Never commit either.
*.profraw
coverage.lcov
/coverage.lcov


# arc 278 #79 — the flake hunt writes full floor logs; the SCRIPT is tracked, its output is not
wat-scripts/hunt/out/

# arc 278 — scripts/floor.sh captures EVERY floor run (a red's arm must survive
# the read). The SCRIPT is tracked; its captures are not.
/.floor/

# arc 278 — preserved pre-change wat binaries for the STASH-DANCE bootstrap
# (wat/fix.wat:23-53). ~22MB each; kept on disk, never committed.
#
# ⛔ THIS ESCAPE HATCH HAS BEEN LOST BEFORE, TWICE. `wat-prekeyword-b472fe3e` (arc 278) was
#    gone by 2026-09-11; that same day a /tmp copy of main's binary died in a WSL crash.
#    An ignored directory is not a record. THIS COMMENT is the record — keep it current.
#
# CURRENT (2026-09-11): bootstrap/wat-main-a3218644d   (+ .PROVENANCE: commit, sha256)
#    main a3218644d: floor 5373/5373 green, clippy 0, PUSHED. PROVEN: converts a pre-flip
#    file where the merge-branch binary dies at startup (merged stdlib fails its purity gate).
#    Its stdlib is frozen in at build time, so it runs codemods against ANY working tree.
#
# REBUILD: git checkout <green-pushed-commit> && cargo build --release && confirm the
#    binary's mtime MOVED (a failed build leaves the previous binary in place — copying it
#    preserves the WRONG one) && cp target/release/wat bootstrap/wat-main-<commit>.
#    Never overwrite. Add new versions alongside.
#
# bootstrap/pctm-gate/{orig,A,B} — 20-file regression set for positional-ctor-to-map
#    (A == B byte-identical; costs ~19 min of the old codemod to regenerate).
bootstrap/
